-- Permutations of lists: equality of all counts, its equivalence laws,
-- splitting a list at an occurrence, and invariance of length, support,
-- and filtering
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
